Design system
  - The design tokens in src/styles/global.css are a verbatim port of the
    Cycladic Sun (light) and Aegean Night v2 (dark) tokens in the CycladesGo
    engine repository, RM-bcn/Naxos-bus-pwa, at
    src/styles/global.css. They are duplicated rather than shared because the
    portal is a separate deployable that cannot import from the engine.

    The provenance of the ported values is therefore the provenance of that
    file. The engine repository is not MIT-licensed: it carries a proprietary
    all-rights-reserved licence for its source code. This notice records that
    the token values were taken from it. Whether that is permitted is a
    question for the copyright holder of the engine repository, not one this
    file settles, and it is recorded here rather than left implicit.

    Two tokens are also written down as literals in src/data/site.ts, and the
    favicon, the 512px logo, the app icons and the Open Graph image are rendered
    from a single SVG source in scripts/generate-assets.ts.

